  "Description": "Putaway (TE=Loc_Item)\n\nImplements TrackingEntity = Loc_Item Code properly - fixes previous versions.  When Receiving, you put the stock into Receiving locations or trolleys.  Then When putting away, Replenish from the trolley or Receiving to the Location.\nThis version has a webtemplate showing what has to be putaway in the chosen Receiving or Trolley location\n\nAlways use Locations with Categories and Types.  In this set of processes for LOC_ITEM, the Locations have Types RECEIVING, STORAGE, and Categories are used for ZONES",
